<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">hunter-eel-scale-vest</ansi> (tailoring recipe)

A close-fitting vest of overlapping scales taken from a drowned
hunter — the dark slip-skin of the cave-eel, mottled grey and
black, light enough to be mistaken for thick cloth. The scales
overlap loose so a knife-arm swings unhindered and a lockpick's
fingers stay free.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       tailoring (minimum 25)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     loom
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> hunter-eel hide (x1), leather strip (x2),
                 thread spool (x2), bone needle (x1)

